[[div class="journal"]]
__**Note:__** This div limits the creation of a double line-break. To achieve one, do the following:
@@ @@
[[<]]
1. At the end of each line of text, press enter.
2. In that new line, encase a space with two sets of {{@@}} (one set per side).
3. Press enter again and continue writing.
[[/<]]
[[/div]]
----
[[div class="text-container-wrap"]]
[[module ListUsers users="."]]
+++ %%title%%
[[/module]]
[[div class="text-container"]]

[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]This is the Text Style div by JaonHax.[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="recv"]]
[[span class="text"]]Really?[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]Yup.[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="recv"]]
[[span class="text"]]But, how do you use it?[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]][[[component:text-style|We have a guide.]]][[/span]]
[[/div]]
