[[span class="text"]][[[component:text-style|A guide?]]] Is this a link?[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]You bet![[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]Please consult the guide -- it tells you exactly how to set this up.[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="recv"]]
[[span class="text"]]Set us up...[[/span]]
[[span class="text" style="font-size: 125%"]]😳[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text" style="font-size: 125%"]]😳[[/span]]
[[/div]]

[[/div]]
[[/div]]
