[[module CSS]]
@import url(https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/component%3Afade-in/1);
[[/module]]

[[iftags +component]]
[[div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 1em;"]]
This component makes everything on the page smoothly fade in, instead of appearing instantly when the page loads.

There's not really any reason to use it and in most cases it makes the page feel a bit pretentious, but if that's what you're looking for, this may be the component for you.

The fade-in effect is applied directly to the contents of the page), the page title, and breadcrumbs. It won't apply to other parts of the page e.g. the sidebar or the header.

+ Usage

[[div class="code"]]
@@[[include :scp-wiki:component:fade-in]]@@
[[/div]]

+ Removing from other themes

Some CSS themes bundle Fade In by default ([[[theme:blankstyle|]]], [[[theme:flopstyle|]]], [[[theme:foxtrot|]]] and [[[theme:queerstyle|]]] at the time of writing). If you'd like to use those themes without Fade In, you can disable it with the following:

[[div class="code"]]
@@[[module CSS]]@@
:root {
@@  --@@fade-in: none;
}
@@[[/module]]@@
[[/div]]

[[/div]]

-----

+ Source code

[[code type="css"]]
/* https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/component:fade-in */

:where(:root) {
  --fade-in: fadeIn;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  :where(#page-title, #breadcrumbs, #page-content) {
    animation-name: var(--fade-in);
    animation-duration: 0.5s;
    animation-iteration-count: 1;
    animation-timing-function: ease-out;
    animation-fill-mode: backwards;
  }
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate(0,15px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate(0,0);
  }
}
[[/code]]

[[/iftags]]


[[module css]]
/* Basic message code */
.text-container .text {
  border-radius: 18px;
  text-align: left;
  display:inline-block;
  padding:8px 12px;
  font-weight:500;
  margin:1.5px 10px;
  max-width: 300px;
}
 
/* Container for "received" messages */
.recv {
  text-align: left;
  margin-right:20px;
}
 
/* Container for "sent" messages */
.sent {
  text-align: right;
  margin-left:20px;
}
.sent .text {
  border-bottom-right-radius: 3px;
  background-color: #267AE9;
  color: white;
}
.recv .text {
  border-bottom-left-radius: 3px;
  background-color: #dadada;
  color: black;
}
 
/* Fancy stuff on the corners of messages with another message from same person above them */
.sent .text:not(:first-child) {
  border-top-right-radius: 4px;
}
.recv .text:not(:first-child) {
  border-top-left-radius: 4px;
}
 
.text-container p {
  margin:0 0 15px;
}
/* Message area stuff */
/* Header styling */
.text-container-wrap h1, .text-container-wrap h2, .text-container-wrap h3, .text-container-wrap h4, .text-container-wrap h5, .text-container-wrap h6 {
  color: black;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin:0 auto 10px;
  position:relative;
  top:-8px;
}
 
/* External box */
.text-container-wrap {
  text-align:center;
  margin:auto;
  display:block;
  margin-top: 25px;
  width:400px;
  padding-top: 25px;
  border-radius:10px;
  border:3px solid #666;
  background-color:#fff;
  overflow:none;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  position:relative;
}

/* Internal box */
.text-container {
  box-shadow:1px 1px 7px #aaa inset;
  margin:0px auto 25px;
  width:350px;
  display:block;
  padding:25px 0px 6px;
  background-color:#f7f7f7;
}
[[/module]]

[[iftags +component]]
[[>]]
[[module Rate]]
[[/>]]

[[=]]
> [[size 125%]]**Made by [[*user JaonHax]]**[[/size]]
[[/=]]

[[size 125%]]
+ Example of usage
[[/size]]
[[div class="text-container-wrap"]]
+++ John Jacob Jingleheimer Schmidt
[[div class="text-container"]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]Now testing messages.[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="recv"]]
[[span class="text"]]Wow, really?[[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]That's so cool! _
And is this a multiline message?[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]You really think so?[[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]That's great![[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]Yup, that has multiple lines![[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="recv"]]
[[span class="text"]]Yeah![[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]Thanks, JaonHax! _
Wait, did I break its scrolling ability somehow?[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]Yup.[[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]I think you did.[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="recv"]]
[[span class="text"]]Ah, well.[[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]I guess JaonHax will just have to make sure that this thing has an infinite maximum height, huh?[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]Yeah, I guess so.[[/span]]
[[span class="text"]]Anyway, we should probably let the awesome individual who's reading this move on with their day.[[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="recv"]]
[[span class="text"]]Bye, Awesome Person![[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="sent"]]
[[span class="text"]]Yeah, bye![[/span]]
[[/div]]
[[/div]]
[[/div]]

[[size 125%]]
+ **How to use this**
[[/size]]

[[collapsible show="+ CSS code for the experts who want to mess with this thing" hide="- Woah, that's a lot, man. I don't know if I can handle all that.]]
[[code type="CSS"]]
/* Basic message code */
.text-container .text {
  border-radius: 18px;
  text-align: left;
  display:inline-block;
  padding:8px 12px;
  font-weight:500;
